                Duration="30 min"
                Level="Advanced" />
            <div class="lesson-body">
                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>Retry Pattern</h2>
                    <pre><code class="language-text">Request → Fail → Wait → Retry → Fail → Wait longer → Retry → Success!

Exponential backoff:
- Attempt 1: immediate
- Attempt 2: wait 1s
- Attempt 3: wait 2s
- Attempt 4: wait 4s (with jitter)</code></pre>
                </section>

                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>Circuit Breaker Pattern</h2>
                    <pre><code class="language-text">States:
┌────────┐   Failures exceed    ┌────────┐
│ CLOSED │ ──────────────────► │  OPEN  │
│(normal)│                      │ (fail) │
└────┬───┘                      └────┬───┘
     │                               │
     │ ◄─────── Success ─────────────┤
     │                               │
     │    After timeout period       │
     │         ┌──────────┐          │
     └─────────│HALF-OPEN │◄─────────┘
               │  (test)  │
               └──────────┘</code></pre>
                </section>

                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>Timeout Pattern</h2>
                    <pre><code class="language-csharp">// Don't wait forever!
using var cts = new CancellationTokenSource(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(5));
var result = await httpClient.GetAsync(url, cts.Token);</code></pre>
                </section>

                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>Bulkhead Pattern</h2>
                    <pre><code class="language-text">Isolate resources to prevent cascade failures:

┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│           Service                   │
│  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────┐        │
│  │ API Pool │  │ DB Pool  │        │
│  │  (10)    │  │   (20)   │        │
│  └──────────┘  └──────────┘        │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘

If API pool exhausted, DB operations continue</code></pre>
                </section>

                <LessonTakeaways>
                    <LessonTakeaway>Retry with exponential backoff for transient failures.</LessonTakeaway>
                    <LessonTakeaway>Circuit breaker prevents cascade failures.</LessonTakeaway>
                    <LessonTakeaway>Timeouts prevent resource exhaustion.</LessonTakeaway>
                    <LessonTakeaway>Bulkheads isolate failures.</LessonTakeaway>
                </LessonTakeaways>
            </div>
